est condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (ground-model cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PreservesCardinal}_S\\)</span> are the imported predicates</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{PreservesCardinal}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ccc\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{PreservesCardinal}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing order and greatest condition are explicit.  The conclusion reuses the canonical preservation predicate, which supplies the quoted forcing-language cardinal formula and the ambient forcing-relation boundary.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2}